Z||000004||AusFiero||07-11-2001||11:40 AM||||On another note, when I have recovered I have decided to hit the USA next year during your summer and check out your local Fiero show scene. Lifes too short and I am going to make the most of it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> So all going well...when I get there I expect to meet at least some of yas  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
